1
00:03:32,727 --> 00:03:38,727
He's X rated and animated!

2
00:07:05,454 --> 00:07:11,454
Fritz the Cat is a animation, comedy, drama film directed by Ralph Bakshi.

3
00:10:38,181 --> 00:10:44,181
In late 1960s New York City, fed up with monotonous college life and police repression, free-spirited
Fritz, an impenitent seducer and unrestrained party-animal, decides to explore the world.

4
00:14:10,909 --> 00:14:16,909
And just like that, as he flees NYC, heading to San Francisco,
Fritz embarks on an endless adventure of illumination.

5
00:17:43,636 --> 00:17:49,636
Immersed in a world surrounded by drugs and sex, Fritz participates in mad orgies, brings about a
revolution, incites mass urban riots, and crosses paths with drug-addled Nazi bikers.

6
00:21:16,363 --> 00:21:22,363
Fritz the Cat (voice), played by Skip Hinnant.

7
